DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T094500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T103000
SUMMARY:Ride to No Jets T.O. Save Our Waterfront Rally and March
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\nThis is an easy\, family-friendly 9 km bi
 ke ride along the western portion of Toronto's Waterfront Trail to the **[
 No Jets T.O. Save Our Waterfront Rally and March](https://www.meetup.com/t
 o-sustainability/events/315602700/).** The route is a scenic paved multi-u
 se path which can be busy on summer days. All ages\, cycling abilities\, a
 nd bikes are welcome (including BikeShare)! A helmet is required for those
  under 18 and is highly encouraged for adult participants. Please make sur
 e your bicycle is in good working order before the event. Dress appropriat
 ely for the weather\, wear sunscreen\, and bring hydration. Washrooms are 
 along the route.\n\n**9:45 am: Meet in the middle of Humber Bay Arch Bridg
 e**\n10:00 am: Depart eastbound along Waterfront Trail\n10:20 am: Pause to
  gather at Lake Shore Blvd W entrance to Coronation Park\n**10:30 am: Arri
 ve at Harbour Square Park and lock bikes for [Rally and March](https://www
 .meetup.com/to-sustainability/events/315602700/)**.\n\nHint: Leave a comme
 nt to coordinate meeting others earlier downtown\, ie at 9:00 am at Harbou
 rfront\, to cycle westward to the meet the group at 9:45 am at Humber Bay 
 Arch Bridge.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontobikemeetup/events/315793969/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260722T201332Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260722T201332Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
