SUMMARY:Allendale Waterfront to Orillia Waterfront Festival 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\n82 km mostly high quality flat smooth com
 pact gravel loop from Allandale Waterfront to Orillia Waterfront Festival.
  930 AM to 1230 pm\n\nPace 15+ km per hour on gravel\n\n1230 pm to 2 pm fe
 stival\n\n2 pm to 5 pm return 41 km\n\nhttps://www.komoot.com/tour/2815987
 697\n\nLast early direct train leaves Barrie at 5 pm\n\nLast direct train 
 leaves Barrie at 8 pm
